          "question": {
            "text": "The value of $\\frac{{ }^{10} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}}{{ }^{11} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}}$, when both the numerator and denominator are at their greatest values, is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
