          "question": {
            "text": "If ${ }^{11} \\mathrm{C}_4+{ }^{11} \\mathrm{C}_5+{ }^{12} \\mathrm{C}_6+{ }^{13} \\mathrm{C}_7={ }^{14} \\mathrm{C}_{\\mathrm{r}}$, then value of $\\mathrm{r}$ is",
